module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.execution_provenance_loss

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data execution_provenance_loss: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "execution_provenance_loss" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**execution-provenance loss** (a reported value is consumed as though an observation produced it, while the carrier holds no proof the observation path ran. ",

    "**Distinct from state-space conflation, and the repair law is what separates them**: there the carrier cannot represent the distinction and the fix is to split the states; here the carrier already has the state — the consumer simply cannot tell whether it was *reached*, and the fix is to bind an execution receipt to the value. ",

    "Three specimens in one night, all on main, none of them a missing variant. ",

    "`known_red_held=206` is `36 held + 170 that RUNTIME-ERRORED`: the substrate splits those into distinct arms, so the states exist; what the quoted figure loses is *did the assertion run*, and an expected-red row that threw is not evidence the red is expected — it is a row whose assertion never executed. ",

    "A floor whose `TerminalLedgerUnrenderable` count is `0` reads identically whether the ledger checks passed or preparation refused before a ledger existed. ",

    "And a `.dag` board of `E0599=23 E0308=128` reads identically whether cargo ran or normalize refused upstream of it. ",

    "**The receipt that makes this worth a row rather than a caution:** for three hours after #8976 put a §4c-illegal annotation inside a match body, the compiler refused at strict preparation while downstream measurements kept producing valid-looking values — one lane concluded a defect was closed, another concluded the same defect was still firing, both citing runs where it could not appear at all; three separate A/B comparisons reported perfect agreement, one because both arms were broken identically, one because a missing flag meant no arm executed, and one because the defect had been fixed between runs so both arms were the same bytes. ",

    "Every one of those is downstream of a single fact: **a masked run and a clean run rendered identically.** Recognition rule: if a count of zero and an unreached stage produce the same output, the number is not an observation. ",

    "The construction move, and it is stronger than naming known masks because it also forecloses the undiscovered ones: any stage capable of preventing a downstream observation from executing must participate in the observation carrier, so `refused before stage N` cannot inhabit the same carrier as `stage N executed with zero findings` — a known mask is a hole someone found, execution provenance is what stops an unfound hole from masquerading as a measurement.)",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
